		<p class="todo">
			A few sentences about you: what you do, what you've built, and what you're working toward as an AI
			architect.
		</p>

		<!-- TODO: write this section in your own words. -->
		<h2>What this blog is about</h2>
		<p class="todo">
			Why you started The Voyager, who it's for, and what readers can expect from each section.
		</p>

		<h2>How the site works</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><a href="/brief/">☕ Daily Brief</a>: the AI news worth knowing each morning, curated with AI.</li>
